# Righteous Valkyrie: "As long as you have at least 7 life more than your starting life total, creatures you control get +2/+2."
# Bot1 starts at 26 (6 above the starting 20): the Valkyrie is a plain 2/4. Its Cleric (Blessed Ghoul 1/1) enters, the trigger
# gains 1 (the Ghoul's toughness, 1: the +2/+2 is not on yet), and 27 is exactly 7 above: the Valkyrie is 4/6 and the Ghoul 3/3
# (every creature, not only the Valkyrie). Bot2's own creatures (Memnite 1/1, a Blessed Ghoul 1/1) are not "creatures you
# control" and Bot2's Ghoul entering, a Cleric Bot1 does not control, gains Bot1 nothing: Bot1 stays on 27.

